{"type":"excalidraw","version":2,"source":"https://philiphendry.me.uk/excalidrawinvisualstudio","elements":[{"id":"j-pa7PjJ6X6z30-A4Fz7Z","type":"text","x":441,"y":230,"width":874.8995361328125,"height":1300,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"a1","roundness":null,"seed":891820002,"version":23,"versionNonce":224838434,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1788987799030,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"NODE STATE\n- Load and reconstitute Node\n- Archive Node\n- Restore Node\n\nNODE IDENTITY AND CLASSIFICATION\n- Rename Node\n- Change Node type\n- Change requested sub-node types\n\nCONTENT ASSOCIATED WITH THE NODE\n- Edit the existing description Document\n- Preserve the same DescriptionId\n\nPARENT RELATIONSHIPS\n- Attach parent\n- Prevent circular relationships\n- Detach parent\n\nSUB-NODE INTERACTION\n- Select requested sub-node type\n- Add sub-node\n- Continue into the separate Node Creation workflow\n\n\nPersisted Node\n      ↓\nReconstituted\n      ↓\nActive ←→ Archived\n      ↓\nModified while retaining NodeId\n\n\nLoad and reconstitute\nRename\nChange type\nChange requested sub-node types\nEdit description\nAttach parent\nDetach parent\nArchive\nRestore\nAdd sub-node entry point\n\n\nThe description-editing section would clearly show that Content owns the actual update:\nNode supplies its existing DescriptionId\n→ Content loads the Document\n→ Content changes the text\n→ Content saves the same DocumentId\n→ Graph Node remains unchanged","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"NODE STATE\n- Load and reconstitute Node\n- Archive Node\n- Restore Node\n\nNODE IDENTITY AND CLASSIFICATION\n- Rename Node\n- Change Node type\n- Change requested sub-node types\n\nCONTENT ASSOCIATED WITH THE NODE\n- Edit the existing description Document\n- Preserve the same DescriptionId\n\nPARENT RELATIONSHIPS\n- Attach parent\n- Prevent circular relationships\n- Detach parent\n\nSUB-NODE INTERACTION\n- Select requested sub-node type\n- Add sub-node\n- Continue into the separate Node Creation workflow\n\n\nPersisted Node\n      ↓\nReconstituted\n      ↓\nActive ←→ Archived\n      ↓\nModified while retaining NodeId\n\n\nLoad and reconstitute\nRename\nChange type\nChange requested sub-node types\nEdit description\nAttach parent\nDetach parent\nArchive\nRestore\nAdd sub-node entry point\n\n\nThe description-editing section would clearly show that Content owns the actual update:\nNode supplies its existing DescriptionId\n→ Content loads the Document\n→ Content changes the text\n→ Content saves the same DocumentId\n→ Graph Node remains unchanged","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"U263Cvhe6qQF6EZY5uASZ","type":"rectangle","x":3631.353043779771,"y":495.28938000765794,"width":43.71492104124721,"height":16.680958928961978,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#364fc7","backgroundColor":"#dbe4ff","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["90A7_lJikpCkEND6_3buB","0nCJ7dcAmJmA7GXMkpHxS"],"frameId":null,"index":"a54","roundness":{"type":3},"seed":1120431284,"version":1365,"versionNonce":1499962676,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1789060440144,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"UKlts2fpki_ewvPwaWS29","type":"text","x":3634.6396405113537,"y":498.0695398291512,"width":38.45887753066234,"height":11.12063928597465,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#364fc7","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["90A7_lJikpCkEND6_3buB","0nCJ7dcAmJmA7GXMkpHxS"],"frameId":null,"index":"a58","roundness":null,"seed":1308669492,"version":1307,"versionNonce":442881716,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1789060440144,"link":"https://github.com/williamowen65/atlas-the-public-think-tank/blob/PTT-68-Disc